  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): The unauthorized change rate measures the percentage of changes deployed without following the established approval process. Per COBIT DSS06, a 30% rate of unapproved deployments directly indicates a control deficiency in change authorization workflows, representing significant governance risk.
